[0.008, "o", "=== TERRARIUM: AI AGENT EXHAUST VISUALIZATION ===\r\n\r\n[Step 1] Examining the taste layer (behaviors.toml)...\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "This declarative file maps AI agent states to crab behaviors.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.004, "o", "# effective_state → behavior. The effective state is derived per crab (spec §5):\r\n#   blocked  — task.needs_user, or a blocked task with no attempt\r\n#   running  — latest attempt.state == \"running\"\r\n#   done     — latest attempt outcome.result in {done, pass}\r\n#   failed   — latest attempt outcome.result in {failed, fail, error}\r\n#   review   — attempt settled but not done/failed (awaiting judgment)\r\n#   queued   — no attempt yet, task.state == \"queued\"\r\n[behavior]\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "queued  = \"wait\"\r\nrunning = \"work\"\r\nreview  = \"inspect\"\r\ndone    = \"deliver\"\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "failed  = \"dig\""]
[0.000, "o", "\r\nblocked = \"stuck\"\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n# AI agent exhaust behaviors (derived from token/cost metrics in attempt payload)\r\n# burning   — high sustained token burn (>3000 tokens or >$10/min)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "# spinning  — rapid retry loop (future: detect from attempt clustering)\r\n# stalled   — no output for threshold time (future: idle detection)\r\n# switching — model changed mid-task (future: detect model_id changes)\r\n# pressured — context window >80% full (future: context_usage_ratio metric)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "...(file continues)\r\n\r\n[Step 2] Generating sample habitat contract with AI agent exhaust data...\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "Generated /tmp/exhaust-demo.json\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "[Step 3] Running terrarium simulator to detect exhaust states...\r\n"]
[0.041, "o", "warning: function `exhaust_state` is never used\r\n  --> src/simulator.rs:97:4\r\n   |\r\n97 | fn exhaust_state(task: &Task) -> Option<String> {\r\n   |    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\n   |\r\n   = note: `#[warn(dead_code)]` (part of `#[warn(unused)]`) on by default\r\n\r\nwarning: `terrarium` (lib) generated 1 warning\r\n    Finished `release` profile [optimized] target(s) in 0.03s\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "     Running `target/release/terrarium view /tmp/exhaust-demo.json`\r\n"]
